(1) A driver's license revoked by the department of public safety for violations within the previous five years;
(2) A conviction for open container and/or transporting alcohol which is not the property of a fare within five years; or
(3) A conviction of three or more moving traffic violations within 24 months of application date.
(Ord. No. 2011-29, § 1, 6-14-11)
